  Description: Prerequisite Region - Eye of Dread You are a fearsome warrior from
    the Hold of Belkzen, and your clan counts on you for support, counsel, and defense.
    With the rising threat of the Whispering Tyrant threatening the safety of your
    home, you must not let your people down. Choose two attribute boosts. One must
    be to Strength or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in the Intimidation skill and the Orc Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Intimidating
    Glare] skill feat.
